# TOEIC Part 5 — Day52

## Q1

The company ____ three new branches since 2020.

A. opens
B. opened
C. has opened
D. opening

**정답: C**

→ since + 시점 → 현재완료

---

## Q2

By next year, the company ____ the new facility.

A. completes
B. completed
C. will have completed
D. completing

**정답: C**

→ 미래의 기준 시점까지 완료 → 미래완료

---

## Q3

The manager arrived after the meeting ____.

A. had started
B. starts
C. has started
D. starting

**정답: A**

→ manager가 도착하기 전에 회의가 시작됨.

---

## Q4

Please ____ the application before the deadline.

A. notify
B. submit
C. postpone
D. extend

**정답: B**

---

## Q5

The company decided to ____ the contract for six months.

A. extend
B. notify
C. submit
D. postpone

**정답: A**

---

## Q6

The manager said that the report ____ incomplete.

A. is
B. was
C. be
D. being

**정답: B**

→ 과거 동사 said 뒤의 시제 일치.

---

## Q7

The event has been ____ until Friday.

A. postponed
B. submitting
C. notifying
D. extending

**정답: A**

→ 현재완료 수동태: has been + p.p.

---

## Q8

We will ____ all applicants of the final decision.

A. extend
B. notify
C. postpone
D. submit

**정답: B**

→ notify A of B = A에게 B를 알리다.

---

## Q9

She ____ at the company for five years.

A. works
B. worked
C. has worked
D. working

**정답: C**

→ for + 기간, 현재까지 이어지는 상황.

---

## Q10

When I arrived, the employees ____ the documents.

A. had already prepared
B. have already prepared
C. prepare
D. preparing

**정답: A**

→ 도착한 시점보다 먼저 준비 완료.

---

# 핵심 정리

* since / for → 현재완료 가능성 확인
* by + 미래 시점 → 미래완료 가능성 확인
* 과거의 두 사건 중 먼저 발생한 일 → 과거완료
* notify A of B
* extend a deadline
* postpone a meeting
